{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_01MHcxST62wt84JPp8baGCoc", "type": "tool_result", "content": "{\"result\":\"### mcp:orders/get_orders\\n\\nFetch all order records in one bulk response.\\n\\n**Call**: `await orders_get_orders()`\\n\\n**Parameters**\\n*(no parameters)*\\n\\n**Returns**\\n- `result` (object[], required)\\n\\nRules for execute_code snippets: every binding is async \u2014 always `await`; call capability functions with keywords exactly as shown (positional calls fail on the default backend); awaiting a capability returns the tool's plain value, already unwrapped \u2014 never index into a ['result'] or ['value'] envelope; `return` a JSON-shaped value.\\nCalls dispatch when invoked, not when awaited \u2014 fan out slow tools instead of paying N x latency: `futures = [fn(x=i) for i in ids]` then `results = [await f for f in futures]`.\\nThe namespace also binds surfaces search does not list: `save_result`/`load_result`.\\nDetails only when needed: toolplane://namespace (full manifest) and skill://driving-toolplane/SKILL.md (conventions).\"}"}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "3cd92a37-d9c3-4809-b2a0-03147fb666ae", "uuid": "37984423-d0c3-46b6-9580-257cbe9c8988", "timestamp": "2026-10-10T12:21:09.765Z", "tool_use_result": {"content": "{\"result\":\"### mcp:orders/get_orders\\n\\nFetch all order records in one bulk response.\\n\\n**Call**: `await orders_get_orders()`\\n\\n**Parameters**\\n*(no parameters)*\\n\\n**Returns**\\n- `result` (object[], required)\\n\\nRules for execute_code snippets: every binding is async \u2014 always `await`; call capability functions with keywords exactly as shown (positional calls fail on the default backend); awaiting a capability returns the tool's plain value, already unwrapped \u2014 never index into a ['result'] or ['value'] envelope; `return` a JSON-shaped value.\\nCalls dispatch when invoked, not when awaited \u2014 fan out slow tools instead of paying N x latency: `futures = [fn(x=i) for i in ids]` then `results = [await f for f in futures]`.\\nThe namespace also binds surfaces search does not list: `save_result`/`load_result`.\\nDetails only when needed: toolplane://namespace (full manifest) and skill://driving-toolplane/SKILL.md (conventions).\"}", "_meta": {"io.modelcontextprotocol/serverInfo": {"name": "Toolplane", "version": "4.1.0"}, "fastmcp": {"wrap_result": true}}, "structuredContent": {"result": "### mcp:orders/get_orders\n\nFetch all order records in one bulk response.\n\n**Call**: `await orders_get_orders()`\n\n**Parameters**\n*(no parameters)*\n\n**Returns**\n- `result` (object[], required)\n\nRules for execute_code snippets: every binding is async \u2014 always `await`; call capability functions with keywords exactly as shown (positional calls fail on the default backend); awaiting a capability returns the tool's plain value, already unwrapped \u2014 never index into a ['result'] or ['value'] envelope; `return` a JSON-shaped value.\nCalls dispatch when invoked, not when awaited \u2014 fan out slow tools instead of paying N x latency: `futures = [fn(x=i) for i in ids]` then `results = [await f for f in futures]`.\nThe namespace also binds surfaces search does not list: `save_result`/`load_result`.\nDetails only when needed: toolplane://namespace (full manifest) and skill://driving-toolplane/SKILL.md (conventions)."}}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_01MHcxST62wt84JPp8baGCoc", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "config", "reason_type": "mode"}}]}
